LRC pressure DAG audit (codex-2026-06-01 S500)

PRESSURE-DAG METHOD
============================================================================================================
Pressure edges compare deletion reliefs: a -> b means a is the more
irreplaceable blocker of b's nearest-neighbor moat.

If the strict pressure graph is a DAG, the search has returned:
  source layer: blockers that can be charged first
  sink layer: most blocked runners
  topological height: length of dependency cascade
  no SCC core: no mutual pressure knot to support a disproof candidate

